{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The NONOLITH consumes you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy and paste the world around you to discover the secrets of this ancient, enigmatic structure. You are very powerful, you just don't know it yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been trapped inside the NONOLITH \u2013 a crystalline structure where untold secrets are hidden in plain sight. Every piece of the world can be moved, rotated, and destroyed. Use this immense power to reach areas you previously thought to be unreachable. Build bridges, dig tunnels, and create your own path to unravel the secrets of the nine worlds within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/741691457168541ecfda4b7f8cd8f3fe.poster.avif?t=1757930490\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/741691457168541ecfda4b7f8cd8f3fe.webm?t=1757930490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/741691457168541ecfda4b7f8cd8f3fe.mp4?t=1757930490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the NONOLITH.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The walls will part for those who know the many truths. Solve puzzles to discover incredible tricks that redefine what is, and has always been, possible. Anything is within your reach, but first you must master the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/b31120320c7c63d9d010075d54accf89.poster.avif?t=1757930490\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/b31120320c7c63d9d010075d54accf89.webm?t=1757930490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/b31120320c7c63d9d010075d54accf89.mp4?t=1757930490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control the NONOLITH.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the most adventurous, escape is only the beginning. Reach the highest level of mastery and the NONOLITH will succumb to your will. Power awaits the few who dare to wield ultimate control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compact experience </strong>with 9 worlds to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creatively solve puzzles</strong>,<strong> </strong>experiment, and enjoy satisfying \u2018aha\u2019 moments\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nothing unlocks</strong>, discover tricks you could\u2019ve used at any time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick your own path</strong> to explore and escape the NONOLITH however you choose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the secrets of the Nonolith</strong>, and be rewarded for your effort</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric soundtrack</strong> by Clockmaker</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/ddd08e44c816a6745e9135ac0854e04c.poster.avif?t=1757930490\" width=576 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/ddd08e44c816a6745e9135ac0854e04c.webm?t=1757930490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/ddd08e44c816a6745e9135ac0854e04c.mp4?t=1757930490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3203340?t=1757930490","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757930490","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/8f69728cb01be4469e9d614cf321f7439b21bf35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757930490","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/8f69728cb01be4469e9d614cf321f7439b21bf35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757930490","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The NONOLITH consumes you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy and paste the world around you to discover the secrets of this ancient, enigmatic structure. You are very powerful, you just don't know it yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been trapped inside the NONOLITH \u2013 a crystalline structure where untold secrets are hidden in plain sight. Every piece of the world can be moved, rotated, and destroyed. Use this immense power to reach areas you previously thought to be unreachable. Build bridges, dig tunnels, and create your own path to unravel the secrets of the nine worlds within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/741691457168541ecfda4b7f8cd8f3fe.poster.avif?t=1757930490\" width=1170 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203340/extras/741691457168541ecfda4b7f8cd8f3fe.webm?t=1757930490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akama